        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/general-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "a) composed of a number of pieces sewed together and mounted on stretcher; strong medium blue satin ground with closely-spaced, large-scale, all-over design (incomplete) of white scalloped-edged ogives with outer frame of lacy points; each ogive having a symmetrical arrangement of flowers, fruit, and grain brocaded in polychrome silks and silver metal thread; serpentine stems bearing fruit and flowers and pomegranates. a) irregular in outline."@en ;
